OL,3,GNEWSAI was told I had no right to be at
OL,4,AEisteddfod, says Reform MS
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MS has said she has faced criticism
OL,7,Ffor attending the National Eisteddfod
OL,8,Fbecause she is a member of Reform.
OL,10,FThe party's deputy Welsh leader, Helen
OL,11,FJenner, said online commenters said she
OL,12,Fhad no right to be at the Welsh
OL,13,Flanguage festival because of her
OL,14,Fmembership of the right-wing party.
OL,16,FJenner, who grew up on Anglesey, said
OL,17,Fthe criticism was ridiculous but that
OL,18,Fit didn't bother her.
OL,20,FShe made the comments to the BBC Wales
OL,21,Fpolitical podcast, Walescast.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
